<title>UK: Seibu Department Stores sets $90 mln four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Seibu Department Stores sets $90 mln four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE SEIBU DEPARTMENT STORES LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DAI-ICHI KANGYO BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
